  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your spells operate even when there is nothing to conduct them.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may cast a void spell in any environment even where nonmagical environment abnormalities would make it impossible, such as casting a fire spell in the void of space. A void spell uses up a spell slot one level higher than the spell’s actual level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/starfinder-to-pathfinder#toc76\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
